emini API 与 AI Studio 上线 Genie 4 实时世界模型","title_en":"Today we are rolling out Genie 4 on the Gemini API and AI Studio🚀","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2123465741592637445"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/gp3hccimt42ak2uh82nrpty65","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"gp3hccimt42ak2uh82nrpty65","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/gp3hccimt42ak2uh82nrpty65","published_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:14Z","ref":"A13","score":86,"selected":true,"source":"X：indigo (@indigox)","summary":"indigo 转发 @YahooFinance 的画面，Dario Amodei 在 Nasdaq 为 Anthropic IPO 敲响开市钟。作者恭喜这家最\"人类\"的科技公司上市，并调侃其敲钟鼓掌的样子怎么像是 AI 生成的。","title":"indigo 转发 Dario Amodei 为 Anthropic IPO 在 Nasdaq 敲钟","title_en":"恭喜 Anthropic IPO 这个最“人类”的科技公司 Nasdaq 敲钟鼓掌怎么像是 AI 生成的 😜","url":"https://x.com/indigox/status/2123464879961186584"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/h4bvsjw4ri6to1inm87srlf42","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"h4bvsjw4ri6to1inm87srlf42","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/h4bvsjw4ri6to1inm87srlf42","published_at":"2026-11-19T17:02:41Z","ref":"A14","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"美国商务部收紧AI芯片出口管制并关闭第三方国家云算力通道后，亚洲多笔大型AI数据中心交易开始瓦解。Moonshot AI取消了与印尼云服务商的1.5亿美元合同，原计划租用Nvidia Blackwell Ultra B300集群训练Kimi K4，此前已预付约50%而非行业标准的15%。台积电和三星暂停向中国客户交付部分处理器，需申请许可；字节跳动、百度昆仑等客户受影响，非AI芯片豁免取消也波及小米、Oppo、vivo等智能手机处理器。","title":"芯片停运叠加海外云通道关闭，中国科技公司面临双重冲击","title_en":null,"url":"https://the-decoder.com/chinese-tech-firms-face-a-double-hit-as-chip-shipments-stop-and-overseas-cloud-access-disappears/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/bj8r4lnrbcoi5cl1asnyn6qt5","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"bj8r4lnrbcoi5cl1asnyn6qt5","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/bj8r4lnrbcoi5cl1asnyn6qt5","published_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:26Z","ref":"A15","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","summary":"Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei 就公司 IPO 发表声明，称今天让公司财务地位更稳固，并强调不会向商业或政治压力低头，将放慢 AI 训练与部